e','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI正式开放GPT-Live-1 API，支持全双工实时语音交互</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic披露今年已阻止多起利用AI模型研发生物武器的尝试</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AI代码编辑器Cursor发布Projects功能，支持调度数千个智能体并行开发</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝发布AI钱包智能体并推出Vibe Pay等三大AI收能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6fad849eb6e6e36aaa909f346a454f5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">支付宝在外滩大会宣布AI支付体系升级，推出AI钱包智能体及Vibe Pay、Skill Pay、Machine Pay三大“AI收”能力。AI钱包智能体旨在管理交易全过程，通过蚂蚁集团自主研发的APASS商业信任基础设施，基于KYA（Know Your Agent）理念，为智能体支付提供身份核验、意图识别及授权管理，实现从“能付”到“可信地付”的跨越。此次升级还涵盖AI周期购、AI帮你抢等新场景，并支持千问AI眼镜、机器狗等具身智能设备完成询价、下单与支付。支付宝数据显示，近5个月智能体代买任务量增长7倍。蚂蚁集团CEO韩歆毅表示，AI支付正成为智能体商业的可信承诺引擎。此外，该体系通过ACT、AMP协议支持全球化商业经营，助力开发者实现AI应用变现，并正与Visa、Mastercard探索KYA框架的互联互通</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">北京金融科技产业联盟发布国内首个智能体金融应用安全团体标准</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/774a9e78917c81c1a9af7e1acab200d9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">北京金融科技产业联盟近日发布《智能体技术金融应用安全要求》，这是国内首个聚焦金融领域智能体应用安全的团体标准。该标准明确规定，第三方智能体未经金融机构授权，不得利用系统权限自动化读取或操作金融App的GUI界面。通过麦克风、截屏、录屏等权限获取数据时，必须遵守被调用方的安全策略。业内将此要求概括为“双重授权”，即智能体操作金融App须同时获得用户与机构授权。该标准由北京国家金融科技认证中心牵头，联合工行、邮储银行、华为、蚂蚁科技、火山引擎、腾讯云等机构共同制定，涵盖初始化与输入、模型推理与决策、身份鉴别与操作、数据安全及风险防控五个维度。此举旨在规范智能体在金融场景的高权限操作，防范绕过官方接口模拟点击带来的账户与资金风险。目前，行业已转向应用方开放接口或采用GUI-MCP协议的合作模式，确保智能体行为在可控范</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI正式开放GPT-Live-1 API，支持全双工实时语音交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/295a1f84c74efe6ec793d6260326337e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式向开发者开放GPT-Live-1 API，允许将ChatGPT同款实时语音能力集成至第三方应用。该模型采用全双工架构，支持边听边说，能自然处理打断、停顿及快速对话，语音前端定价为每分钟0.05美元。GPT-Live-1将实时交互与深度推理分离，开发者可按需搭配后台模型，以平衡复杂任务处理与成本。在Full Duplex Bench测试中，其表现较GPT-Realtime-2.1提升30个百分点，并在Tau3评估中位居首位。该模型原生支持电话场景，提供关键词偏置、轮次检测及多语言口音优化，适用于餐厅预约、客户支持及语言学习等领域。通过API接入，开发者可构建具备实时响应能力的语音智能体，并结合Codex等工具实现复杂业务流程自动化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic披露今年已阻止多起利用AI模型研发生物武器的尝试</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic近日披露，今年已成功阻止多起利用其AI技术开展可能涉及生物武器研发的研究尝试。在列举的五个案例中，相关行为者通过绕过管控措施及混淆研究目的试图规避安全防护。其中一例涉及来自不受支持地区的研究人员，利用Claude模型耗时数周规划禽流感实验，Anthropic通过安全过滤机制将该任务限制在性能最弱的模型上，并已封禁相关账户。公司强调，研发制造生物武器与研发疫苗所需信息存在重叠，目前无法确定研究人员的主观意图。此次披露旨在推动AI行业及各国政府就新兴生物风险展开讨论。随着Mythos等先进模型发布，AI在生物学领域的应用安全引发广泛关注，专家呼吁加强监管，以防范恐怖组织或国家行为体利用AI创造病毒或释放有害病原体。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI代码编辑器Cursor发布Projects功能，支持调度数千个智能体并行开发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ac28462e70fb53f6c74eb9fb3a49d45e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI代码编辑器Cursor于9月10日正式推出Projects（beta版）功能，旨在通过“协调者智能体”调度数千个子智能体，实现大型复杂应用的自动化开发与维护。该功能核心架构包含三大支柱：支持云端运行与按需本地测试以突破算力限制；通过共享系统上下文沉淀代码库理解与偏好；引入智能订阅机制，实现对Slack、PR及定时任务的主动监控与响应。Projects主要应用于功能开发、大规模代码迁移及持续性维护场景。官方数据显示，深度使用该功能的用户合并PR数量提升至原来的六倍。目前，Projects已向所有用户逐步开放，旨在将开发者从繁琐的智能体管理中解放，转向直接指挥任务目标，显著提升复杂工程的交付效率。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
